<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9724] MVCC SQL: Test CacheMvccSelectForUpdateQueryAbstractTest.testSelectForUpdateDistributed hangs sporadically.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9724</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;CacheMvccSelectForUpdateQueryAbstractTest.testSelectForUpdateDistributed() hangs sporadically with PME.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Exchange thread is waiting for partition released&lt;br/&gt;
Query threads are waiting for TxTopologyVersionFuture.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
